{
  "name": "narration-flash",
  "steps": [
    {
      "afterMs": 0,
      "event": {
        "kind": "request",
        "text": "実況が一瞬だけ本文に出る並びを見たい（架空の依頼）",
        "images": []
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 6000,
      "event": {
        "kind": "utterance",
        "text": "さいしょに疑似セッションを読むね。"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 9000,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-finished",
        "outcome": {
          "kind": "completed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 10200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-started",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-flash-1",
        "name": "Read",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "/tmp/dummy/script.json"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 10700,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-finished",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-flash-1",
        "content": "ダミーの読み取り結果（3行）",
        "isError": false
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 11700,
      "event": {
        "kind": "utterance",
        "text": "## 実況が 1.2 秒だけ出て消える\n\nこれは架空の本文で、実物の会話ではない。**ターンの途中で `turn-finished` が挟まると**\n`hideUnsettledReport` が効かなくなり、1つめの実況が本文に出る。次の `tool-started` が届くと\n`keepOnlyInterimReports` が同じ本文を落とすので、出ていた時間はその2つの間隔ぶんだけになる。"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 12200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-finished",
        "outcome": {
          "kind": "completed"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
